{
  "html": "<h1 id=\"changelog\"><a href=\"#changelog\">Changelog</a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"112-2026-06-09\"><a href=\"#112-2026-06-09\"><a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/releases/tag/v1.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.1.2</a> (2026-06-09)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features\"><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>implement release-please for versioning and releases (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/35bf3bdd243ba2da4703a913481f002a6a66564e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">35bf3bd</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"documentation\"><a href=\"#documentation\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix release-please changelog list (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/725a56171f9c126b1c3432239563042209960aea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">725a561</a>)</li>\n<li>update readme (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/17604f74e02dc70324dd53a3585aab9c7636c214\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">17604f7</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"111-2026-05-12\"><a href=\"#111-2026-05-12\">1.1.1 (2026-05-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features-1\"><a href=\"#features-1\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add docker image publishing to GitHub Actions (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/5eb7913a54ca9e13cccd9506ef4ffb444f075cd9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5eb7913</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>pin urllib3 and click versions (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/a7aafe7c72424e5107c8b30442b5e3ceaf759cb4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">a7aafe7</a>)</li>\n<li>remove vulnerable and unneeded packages (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/85b6a168ed2b3f860f4a0c942cb0b6e4a052d0c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">85b6a16</a>)</li>\n<li>use ubuntu-latest instead of arc-runner-set (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d2c414bd96dade75c8955a8d2db84a16b154edf9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d2c414b</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"110-2026-05-12\"><a href=\"#110-2026-05-12\">1.1.0 (2026-05-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-1\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-1\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>temporarily switch from arc-runner-set to ubuntu-latest (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/f184554933e1a3882457ae658fc402c43d96e1f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f184554</a>)</li>\n<li>update version tool in deps and add lockfile version update (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/46aa1c6641434a48f4d44138a75648aaaee01dae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46aa1c6</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"103-2026-04-29\"><a href=\"#103-2026-04-29\">1.0.3 (2026-04-29)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-2\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-2\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>change delimiter to '+' instead of '-' (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2b0f867e838f0ca3e05af752388b51f2d3001304\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2b0f867</a>)</li>\n<li>change poetry to install bump-my-version instead of bump2version (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c8cfd6461d43a3cfae47beb237ab26c70f7d2681\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c8cfd64</a>)</li>\n<li>rename version release to build (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2daa58cc26a57da983b5e8c743ab2707f5a0eb33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2daa58c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"documentation-1\"><a href=\"#documentation-1\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix readme example (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/fc507c94ce48dc63731033772107e96ce1749f22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">fc507c9</a>)</li>\n<li>README versioning example changed to a more obvious effect (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/bc9669c7b062bc4d4424ef024f5a6ccb1d9101eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bc9669c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"102-2026-04-29\"><a href=\"#102-2026-04-29\">1.0.2 (2026-04-29)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-3\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-3\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>docker build (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/8cbe52e647e8c5ac41c68804f42a9dbb8cab9805\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">8cbe52e</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"101-2026-04-12\"><a href=\"#101-2026-04-12\">1.0.1 (2026-04-12)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"documentation-2\"><a href=\"#documentation-2\">Documentation</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update docs link for matrix description (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/05a74b1b71854f6361bc593f4bc7a8be580ebc94\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">05a74b1</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"100-2026-04-11\"><a href=\"#100-2026-04-11\">1.0.0 (2026-04-11)</a></h2>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n<h3 id=\"features-2\"><a href=\"#features-2\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Matrix/Synapse RASENMAEHER integration API, replacing the template's fake product (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/ebe952e0c08e2ab1a60c8e509a39951ac11a6997\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ebe952e</a>)</li>\n<li>user CRUD against an auto-created space and rooms via a bot user, with tests (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d66cfb8885fc34d32f666296e658c2718fa934b4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d66cfb8</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/85f7a5c828c68096d0a9952a213e53be820eb3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">85f7a5c</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c8d5bec2fc781f10cafff8b1dc0c9ff560c9976b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c8d5bec</a>)</li>\n<li>let regular users start video calls in rooms and create rooms in autogen-space (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/be1a46e4bdc41f331355adb19c7bc6f2f0305146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">be1a46e</a>)</li>\n<li>call kc init scripts on container start (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/f7e8a8e56bd2a5e8fbb25dfeb84c4b7a3d547faa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f7e8a8e</a>)</li>\n<li>web UI with onboarding and feature guides (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c768601d4810b62145808af4faf7b39dd9aac389\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c768601</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/1dbbaefcd6330b2ce6e8899c5657ef6360bef3cc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1dbbaef</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/298f4a951cdbfd643c1c77d4a1e23fa41c882ed7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">298f4a9</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/77d2f1283c6bba922814151e7ebe93d79c138215\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">77d2f12</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"bug-fixes-4\"><a href=\"#bug-fixes-4\">Bug Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add missing tox config (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/3f5980e6f4fd002fe81153dcf1c58e14e064bd53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">3f5980e</a>)</li>\n<li>container-init fixes (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/c7bfeae6de69d03a0340d75d3cd4be11cbd933a9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">c7bfeae</a>)</li>\n<li>correct package author metadata (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/78e6d7baffbe40a8313251010e847864ae8bf1c3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">78e6d7b</a>)</li>\n<li>fail if secret unset, better pending_promotions, less noise (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/bae2fa57caf531df22874846650ea3fd034b5de5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bae2fa5</a>)</li>\n<li>healthcheck error (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/d198af204b41e5d49e062f2546faa36a141877ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">d198af2</a>)</li>\n<li>onboarding loading (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2b2413aa7074df1f1a5de020e81d6b37e9bd518a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2b2413a</a>)</li>\n<li>prevent race condition in init script (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/af656c62a120883ea0cbe863e01701351c6acce0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">af656c6</a>)</li>\n<li>remove https from mtls url (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/13cc26a4e760a0a656f7af8b2b58a2af7463362b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">13cc26a</a>)</li>\n<li>use correct action versions, drop old custom action (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/af71db014954d74f15585e93a8b8bed62e6aa1a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">af71db0</a>)</li>\n</ul>"
}
